            "detailed_description": "<strong>YANKAI'S PEAK.</strong> is a love letter to <strong>PYRAMIDS</strong>. A colorful <strong>PYRAMID</strong>-pushing puzzle game about the beauty and joy of being a sentient blue <strong>PYRAMID</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pretty cool gameplay.<br></li><li> Over 130 handcrafted levels.<br></li><li> 7 PARTs each exploring a unique multifaceted mechanic.<br></li><li> Meditative sound design.<br></li><li> A sick intro.</li></ul><br>A game by Kenny Sun.<br>Music by JACK+JIM.<br><br>(YANKAI is pronounced YEN - KYE).",
